<block><txt break.before="1">An Act to make certain provisions in relation to
actions of tort and in relation to rights against third parties; to amend the
law with respect to proceedings against, and contributions between,
tort-feasors; and for purposes connected therewith.</txt></block>

<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>long title:</b> Am 2017
No 19, Sch 1 [1].</txt></content>
</tier>
</content>


